---
import SectionGlow from "./SectionGlow.astro";
---

<section id="diagnostico" class="relative overflow-hidden py-24">
  <SectionGlow flip />
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="reveal mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
    <span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-petrol">Diagnóstico de la Realidad Local</span>
    <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-petrol sm:text-4xl">
      La brecha entre el vecino con ganas de emprender y la burocracia municipal
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
    <div
      class="reveal rounded-2xl border border-emerald/45 bg-emerald/22 p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-emerald/50"
    >
      <div class="grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-emerald text-petrol shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(80,200,135,0.3)]">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
          ><path
            d="M12 9v4m0 4h.01M10.29 3.86 1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0Z"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.8"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg
        >
      </div>
      <h3 class="mt-5 font-bold text-petrol">Barrera de Entrada & Miedo</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-petrol/90">
        El vecino ve la formalización como un laberinto legal y tributario hostil, prefiriendo operar en la
        informalidad.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="reveal rounded-2xl border border-teal/45 bg-teal/22 p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-teal/50"
    >
      <div class="grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-teal/15 text-teal">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"
          ><path
            d="M12 6v6l4 2"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.8"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"
          ></circle></svg
        >
      </div>
      <h3 class="mt-5 font-bold text-petrol">Sobrecarga de Fomento y Rentas</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-petrol/90">
        Funcionarios municipales dedican cientos de horas a responder las mismas preguntas básicas en ventanilla.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="reveal rounded-2xl border border-petrol/30 bg-petrol/16 p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-petrol/40"
    >
      <div class="grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-petrol/20 text-petrol">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"
          ><path
            d="M12 1v22M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H7"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.8"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg
        >
      </div>
      <h3 class="mt-5 font-bold text-petrol">Pérdida de Ingresos Propios</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-petrol/90">
        Comunas con alta actividad comercial informal que no perciben derechos de patentes comerciales ni aseo.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>
